@@ -9,4 +9,7 @@ Every task returned by `add` has a unique, stable string `id`. Use `get(id)` to
 rename; `find`, `complete`, `reopen`, `rename`, `tag`, `untag`, and `remove` accept either its title
 or its ID.
 
+Tasks also expose `createdAt` and `updatedAt` as ISO-8601 date-time strings. They are initially equal;
+each successful completion, reopening, rename, tag, or untag operation refreshes `updatedAt`.
+
 Run its tests with `npm test`.
